# Vault

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the vault root.

Before changing the vault, read `10 Projects/Personal System/Project.md`. Stay inside its current Next item. When a slice is finished, update Done and Next there. If a working decision changes, edit Working decisions and say why under Done.

Markdown in this vault is the record. Do not invent a second database, learning subjects, a project app, or an automation layer until that project note decides it.
